  "prefLabel": "Csp 406.01 New Hampshire Scholar GPA Requirement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 406.01 New Hampshire Scholar GPA Requirement. Scholarship recipients who have earned the New Hampshire scholar designation and received a scholarship award of $2,000.00 per year shall maintain at least a 2.5 cumulative GPA, verified by the participating postsecondary institution on an annual basis in order to retain their scholarship.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/csp100-700.html"
